    "action": "A fresh read-only, metadata-only resolver-path diagnostic; no further signal, config mutation, wheel rebuild or qualification retry yet.",
    "mechanism": "Compile a tiny source-bound helper with the actual macOS SDK, compare direct C gethostbyaddr/getnameinfo with a fixed loopback PTR DNSServiceQueryRecord using a shared connection and the Libinfo query flags ShareConnection, ReturnIntermediates and Timeout. Retain a simple DNSServiceQueryRecord control, callback flags/error/interface/record metadata and bounded completion; keep original five-second external bounds.",
    "primary_source": "https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/Libinfo/blob/39b70c515baee5b609e7e91693edbd934b6845a1/lookup.subproj/mdns_module.c#L561-L659",
    "query_flags_source": "https://github.com/apple-oss-distributions/Libinfo/blob/39b70c515baee5b609e7e91693edbd934b6845a1/lookup.subproj/mdns_module.c#L1275-L1333",
    "reason": "Apple Libinfo mdns_hostbyaddr routes reverse lookups through _mdns_search_ex; _mdns_query_start adds the shared-connection/intermediate/timeout flags. Earlier dns-sd -m -Q observations did not establish equivalent flags, callback completion or libc success. This isolates libc/shared-query completion from service selection, without assuming a cache purge will cure it.",
    "source_limit": "Libinfo-600 source informs the experiment; this is not a claim that the hosted dyld shared-cache image was byte-matched to that source. Actual compiled helper, SDK/runtime identity and outcomes must be retained."
  },
